1
00:00:19,511 --> 00:00:24,718
The actors here act according to the script.

2
00:00:24,718 --> 00:00:28,926
There are no tricks like special effects here.

3
00:00:28,926 --> 00:00:34,850
Although I live in a small world trapped in a cage.

4
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:38,401
Truman is real

5
00:00:38,401 --> 00:00:41,766
There's no script or cue cards

6
00:00:41,766 --> 00:00:49,900
It's the real life of an actual person

7
00:00:50,985 --> 00:00:54,209
I'm hopeless

8
00:00:54,209 --> 00:00:58,200
Leave me and go alone

9
00:01:01,288 --> 00:01:03,665
Don't say that

10
00:01:03,665 --> 00:01:09,200
We must cross the mountain even if we have only one life left.

11
00:01:12,137 --> 00:01:16,404
This program gives viewers comfort.

12
00:01:17,463 --> 00:01:19,800
You've gone mad.

13
00:01:22,556 --> 00:01:26,689
My private life and social life are separate.

14
00:01:26,689 --> 00:01:30,319
My life is my own, like Truman Show.

15
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:35,907
The life Truman Show captures is sublime...

16
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:39,617
It's a blessed life.

17
00:01:39,617 --> 00:01:42,291
"I can't help it."

18
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:47,292
"Okay, just one promise."

19
00:01:47,292 --> 00:01:54,310
"Since I'll die first, eat my body and exert yourself."

20
00:01:54,310 --> 00:01:57,434
I'm nauseous.

21
00:01:59,312 --> 00:02:01,815
This is really life.

22
00:02:01,815 --> 00:02:05,565
Our team is really everything from one to ten.

23
00:02:05,565 --> 00:02:07,500
It's just a little control.

24
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:15,363
Truman Shaw

25
00:02:15,363 --> 00:02:19,670
"Man, it's an order!"

26
00:02:24,090 --> 00:02:28,083
"I love you all, I love you all."

27
00:02:28,083 --> 00:02:31,300
Wait, it'll be late

28
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:34,765
Okay, I get it.

29
00:02:43,361 --> 00:02:46,722
10,909th day

30
00:02:46,937 --> 00:02:50,279
Good morning / Good morning

31
00:02:50,279 --> 00:02:56,915
Hello in advance, good afternoon, good evening, good night

32
00:02:56,915 --> 00:02:59,615
Truman/ Spencer sir

33
00:02:59,615 --> 00:03:00,500
No way, no way

34
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:03,200
You're good, get out

35
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:05,600
I know, you've been wearing clothes

36
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:08,000
Let's go, Pluto

37
00:03:51,168 --> 00:03:52,600
I'll deliver the news

38
00:03:52,600 --> 00:04:00,384
There was a plane crash in Shihheien earlier

39
00:04:00,384 --> 00:04:03,046
How are you feeling today?

40
00:04:03,046 --> 00:04:06,095
Do you have a good plan? / No

41
00:04:06,095 --> 00:04:11,649
I'm fine, let's set aside the bad news about the plane crash

42
00:04:11,649 --> 00:04:16,579
I'll play some music to calm your mood

43
00:04:19,022 --> 00:04:22,296
Please give me the pet newspaper / Here it is

44
00:04:22,296 --> 00:04:24,948
Thank you / You're welcome

45
00:04:24,948 --> 00:04:27,004
Al, give me a newspaper

46
00:04:27,004 --> 00:04:32,764
And...this is something you need to bring home

47
00:04:32,764 --> 00:04:35,336
You're really a silly person / Saying that would be nagging

48
00:04:35,336 --> 00:04:37,892
Let's see.

49
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:51,993
Truman, hello.

50
00:04:51,993 --> 00:04:53,359
Hello

51
00:04:53,359 --> 00:04:55,869
Is the weather nice?/ It's always like that

52
00:04:55,869 --> 00:04:58,208
Is the wife well?

53
00:04:58,208 --> 00:05:00,152
Yes, and the mistress too?

54
00:05:00,152 --> 00:05:03,330
Of course she is well

55
00:05:03,330 --> 00:05:05,000
The conversation was enjoyable/ Me too

56
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,048
Then I'll go

57
00:05:06,048 --> 00:05:07,995
Think about insurance/ That's right

58
00:05:07,995 --> 00:05:12,923
We will specially handle the special insurance for twins

59
00:05:19,604 --> 00:05:22,052
Are you coming in? Go first

60
00:05:22,052 --> 00:05:25,220
You go first, I can take my time

61
00:05:39,954 --> 00:05:44,071
I want to find someone who lives on the island of sebaceous glands

62
00:05:44,071 --> 00:05:48,410
"Sky Kingdom Shiheaven" / Truman, look at this

63
00:05:48,410 --> 00:05:55,046
I'm sorry, but we don't have any suitable products.

64
00:05:55,046 --> 00:05:57,089
Yes, I'm going to the island.

65
00:05:57,089 --> 00:06:01,435
Do you know someone named Lauren Garland?

66
00:06:01,435 --> 00:06:03,632
No?

67
00:06:03,632 --> 00:06:10,357
I see, then what about Sylvia Garland?

68
00:06:10,357 --> 00:06:13,260
No?

69
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:18,240
Yes, thank you.

70
00:06:50,847 --> 00:06:52,484
Lawrence? Truman

71
00:06:52,484 --> 00:06:58,444
I need to go on a business trip to Wellespark.

72
00:06:58,444 --> 00:07:02,855
Wellespark?

73
00:07:02,855 --> 00:07:04,447
In Harbour Island?

74
00:07:04,447 --> 00:07:07,580
Is there another place?/ I can't do it

75
00:07:07,580 --> 00:07:12,245
I have to go to the dentist

76
00:07:12,245 --> 00:07:18,138
It's better to lose a job than to have a toothache

77
00:07:18,138 --> 00:07:20,627
There'll be a lot of trouble because of the budget cut

78
00:07:20,627 --> 00:07:23,931
Cut?/ Yes, you take care of it

79
00:07:23,931 --> 00:07:29,719
It's nice to feel the sea breeze again

80
00:07:29,719 --> 00:07:32,401
Thank you

81
00:07:38,191 --> 00:07:40,103
"Harbor Island"

82
00:07:40,103 --> 00:07:43,657
Hello? Have we not left yet?

83
00:07:43,657 --> 00:07:45,074
One photo please

84
00:07:45,074 --> 00:07:47,669
One way or round trip?

85
00:07:47,669 --> 00:07:51,620
Round trip

86
00:07:51,620 --> 00:07:54,873
I'm here

87
00:08:51,001 --> 00:08:52,717
Shall I help you?

88
00:08:52,717 --> 00:08:57,386
Just go, I'm fine

89
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:13,816
I've come

90
00:09:13,816 --> 00:09:17,403
Look at what I bought

91
00:09:17,403 --> 00:09:18,795
It's 'Chef's Pal'

92
00:09:18,795 --> 00:09:26,144
That's where they peel vegetables and fruits in the kitchen

93
00:09:26,144 --> 00:09:29,117
You're really good at it

94
00:09:29,117 --> 00:09:35,023
Hey, clean your butt

95
00:09:47,535 --> 00:09:51,860
Beer should be this good

96
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:53,815
Do you know what I'm thinking?

97
00:09:53,815 --> 00:09:56,203
What are you thinking?

98
00:09:56,203 --> 00:10:00,749
What if I quit my job and leave here?

99
00:10:00,749 --> 00:10:04,422
What about the job? You're doing well

100
00:10:04,422 --> 00:10:11,666
You're an office worker, I'm envious of you

101
00:10:11,666 --> 00:10:12,546
Take it

102
00:10:12,546 --> 00:10:15,258
Try running a vending machine business / No

103
00:10:15,258 --> 00:10:17,983
It's fun

104
00:10:17,983 --> 00:10:22,312
Don't you want to leave?

105
00:10:22,312 --> 00:10:25,773
Where are you going?

106
00:10:25,773 --> 00:10:28,356
Oil

107
00:10:28,356 --> 00:10:36,582
Where is the oil? In Florida?

108
00:10:36,582 --> 00:10:37,959
You can see it?

109
00:10:37,959 --> 00:10:45,800
This is our island. If you keep going straight, you'll reach Fiji.

110
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:50,809
Once you leave, it's too far to come back.

111
00:10:50,809 --> 00:10:58,348
There are islands in Fiji that no human foot has ever touched.

112
00:10:58,348 --> 00:11:03,307
When are you leaving?

113
00:11:03,307 --> 00:11:07,357
It's not that simple.

114
00:11:07,357 --> 00:11:13,651
You can't just leave without any money or plan.

115
00:11:13,651 --> 00:11:15,364
Right

116
00:11:15,364 --> 00:11:19,200
Don't worry, I'll go

117
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:26,452
The time is near

118
00:11:26,452 --> 00:11:30,806
A drink? / No

119
00:11:49,237 --> 00:11:52,775
The weather is bad, let's go back

120
00:11:52,775 --> 00:11:56,502
Just a little more / Let's go back

121
00:11:56,502 --> 00:12:01,111
Please just a little more / Okay

122
00:12:02,540 --> 00:12:08,710
Dad!

123
00:13:18,787 --> 00:13:21,652
You got completely soaked, where were you?

124
00:13:21,652 --> 00:13:23,784
Eight thousand dollars is enough

125
00:13:23,784 --> 00:13:27,451
That's the sound again. It would cover a year's expenses

126
00:13:27,451 --> 00:13:31,791
After going and coming, if it was five years ago, you wouldn't know

127
00:13:31,791 --> 00:13:34,175
Stop acting like a child

128
00:13:34,175 --> 00:13:36,419
You still look young

129
00:13:36,419 --> 00:13:39,390
Haven't you even paid off the loan yet?

130
00:13:39,390 --> 00:13:43,425
There's also the car installment. Let's go on a trip then?

131
00:13:43,425 --> 00:13:46,271
It's an adventure

132
00:13:46,271 --> 00:13:51,732
Now you need to have a baby. Why bother with adventures?

133
00:13:51,732 --> 00:13:58,000
You can take it slowly. Explore this wide world

134
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:01,866
I want to explore

135
00:14:01,866 --> 00:14:08,924
Yeah, everyone has that thought

136
00:14:08,924 --> 00:14:15,032
Let's stop talking like this and come to bed

137
00:14:15,032 --> 00:14:22,087
Turn on the camera and play music at night

138
00:14:22,087 --> 00:14:27,604
Turn off the lights and draw the curtains, nothing will be visible

139
00:14:30,733 --> 00:14:34,359
Please give me the pet newspaper/ Here it is

140
00:14:34,359 --> 00:14:37,733
Thank you

141
00:14:37,733 --> 00:14:42,195
Give me the newspaper

142
00:14:42,195 --> 00:14:44,751
I should buy another one too

143
00:14:44,751 --> 00:14:48,115
For the wife?/ You understand well

144
00:14:48,115 --> 00:14:51,400
Anything else?/ This is enough

145
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:54,574
Goodbye

146
00:15:14,807 --> 00:15:18,654
Father?

147
00:15:18,654 --> 00:15:23,147
What are you doing!

148
00:15:23,147 --> 00:15:27,988
Get away! Stand there!

149
00:15:27,988 --> 00:15:30,078
Stand there!

150
00:15:30,078 --> 00:15:32,790
No way! Stand there!

151
00:15:32,790 --> 00:15:36,464
Open the door, it's our father

152
00:15:36,464 --> 00:15:40,225
Stop the car, stop!

153
00:15:40,225 --> 00:15:46,062
That's what it means!

154
00:16:04,791 --> 00:16:07,679
I fully understand your feelings

155
00:16:07,679 --> 00:16:11,407
I also read it every day, but his appearance is always different

156
00:16:11,407 --> 00:16:15,263
Sometimes he seems like a complete stranger

157
00:16:15,263 --> 00:16:19,536
He really was a father, his clothes were rebellious

158
00:16:19,536 --> 00:16:25,707
But suddenly people loaded him onto the bus and sent him away

159
00:16:25,707 --> 00:16:31,519
Probably they want to catch the rebels before it gets cold

160
00:16:31,519 --> 00:16:39,906
How could there be someone exactly like twins?

161
00:16:39,906 --> 00:16:42,558
Do you have a brother?

162
00:16:42,558 --> 00:16:53,825
You know your father is a reader, just like you.

163
00:16:53,825 --> 00:16:58,210
You, it's because of old matters that you feel guilty.

164
00:16:58,210 --> 00:17:04,219
You're like a ship in a storm.

165
00:17:04,219 --> 00:17:13,269
I've never blamed you, it's not your fault.

166
00:17:56,909 --> 00:18:01,107
Hey

167
00:18:01,107 --> 00:18:05,107
What are you doing here?

168
00:18:05,107 --> 00:18:10,446
Fix the lawnmower

169
00:18:10,446 --> 00:18:12,073
I saw my father today

170
00:18:12,073 --> 00:18:15,959
I know

171
00:18:15,959 --> 00:18:19,903
My mother called

172
00:18:19,903 --> 00:18:22,624
You don't need to get so worked up, do you?

173
00:18:22,624 --> 00:18:25,542
Why did you come down here?

174
00:18:25,542 --> 00:18:30,139
I made macaroni/I'm not hungry

175
00:18:30,139 --> 00:18:40,807
That old thing is outdated, new products have come out

176
00:19:13,922 --> 00:19:15,631
What are you doing?

177
00:19:15,631 --> 00:19:18,645
I'm remembering memories while looking at the scarf

178
00:19:18,645 --> 00:19:22,060
Which memory?

179
00:20:13,116 --> 00:20:15,904
Sorry/It's okay?

180
00:20:15,904 --> 00:20:18,698
I'm really sorry/It's okay

181
00:20:18,698 --> 00:20:22,746
Why am I such an idiot?/It's okay

182
00:20:22,746 --> 00:20:27,875
My ankle is so painful, I'm sorry for making you fall

183
00:20:27,875 --> 00:20:29,667
It's okay, don't worry

184
00:20:29,667 --> 00:20:32,751
I'm Merle/I'm Truman

185
00:20:32,751 --> 00:20:35,467
Nice to see you

186
00:21:59,502 --> 00:22:04,551
Truman, stop it / It's not okay, you have to remember this

187
00:22:04,551 --> 00:22:07,433
Stop and go / Okay

188
00:22:07,433 --> 00:22:11,891
I won't lend you notes anymore

189
00:22:11,891 --> 00:22:15,814
Dislike? You're worse than me

190
00:22:15,814 --> 00:22:19,118
See you later / Have a good day

191
00:22:19,118 --> 00:22:21,647
Leaving, you're a loser

192
00:23:21,966 --> 00:23:27,593
Hello?

193
00:23:27,593 --> 00:23:31,722
Gonichu?

194
00:23:31,722 --> 00:23:38,440
I have a Japanese book./ Yeah.

195
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:43,079
Lorentz?

196
00:23:43,079 --> 00:23:46,079
Lorentz, right.

197
00:23:46,079 --> 00:23:48,370
I'm Truman Burbank.

198
00:23:48,370 --> 00:23:54,332
Well, I can't talk about it with you

199
00:23:54,332 --> 00:23:57,958
Really?

200
00:23:57,958 --> 00:24:01,872
Yes, because I'm a dangerous person

201
00:24:01,872 --> 00:24:05,139
I'm sorry, I can't help it

202
00:24:05,139 --> 00:24:10,053
You have to be careful

203
00:24:10,053 --> 00:24:13,435
Do you have a boyfriend? That's not it

204
00:24:13,435 --> 00:24:19,316
Because of the girl I was with? It's not related, we were just friends

205
00:24:19,316 --> 00:24:20,398
That's not it

206
00:24:20,398 --> 00:24:24,521
Did I upset you? That's why

207
00:24:24,521 --> 00:24:27,534
No

208
00:24:27,534 --> 00:24:33,488
How will it end? / Wow, I'm curious too.

209
00:24:33,488 --> 00:24:42,756
When should I go pizza eating on Friday or whenever?

210
00:24:42,756 --> 00:24:44,014
Saturday? No way.

211
00:24:44,014 --> 00:24:47,307
Sunday, Monday, Tuesday?

212
00:24:47,307 --> 00:24:50,468
Now

213
00:24:50,468 --> 00:24:54,516
It's a test tomorrow?/ I know

214
00:24:54,516 --> 00:25:00,253
You have to do it now, don't you understand?

215
00:25:00,253 --> 00:25:03,647
What should I do?

216
00:25:36,013 --> 00:25:40,434
Don't give up!

217
00:25:55,999 --> 00:25:58,745
It's my favorite pizza place

218
00:25:58,745 --> 00:26:02,956
Tony, give me something big

219
00:26:02,956 --> 00:26:06,009
I don't have time, he'll come soon

220
00:26:06,009 --> 00:26:09,593
Who?/ I can't talk to you

221
00:26:09,593 --> 00:26:11,671
Then don't do it

222
00:26:25,263 --> 00:26:28,401
Here she is

223
00:26:28,401 --> 00:26:29,497
Truman/ Who is that?

224
00:26:29,497 --> 00:26:33,371
I've heard everything about you.

225
00:26:33,371 --> 00:26:36,315
I'm just pretending not to know, but everyone knows you.

226
00:26:36,315 --> 00:26:38,791
Loreen.../ My name isn't Loreen.

227
00:26:38,791 --> 00:26:41,195
I'm Sylvia./ Sylvia?

228
00:26:41,195 --> 00:26:43,425
Lorene, why are you doing this again?

229
00:26:43,425 --> 00:26:46,175
Hold on, who is that? / That's my daughter

230
00:26:46,175 --> 00:26:48,964
What do you mean? / I've never seen that person before

231
00:26:48,964 --> 00:26:52,095
It's a lie, Truman, believe me

232
00:26:52,095 --> 00:26:55,303
This one's fake too, it was all made because of you

233
00:26:55,303 --> 00:26:57,060
This is a set, it's a TV show

234
00:26:57,060 --> 00:27:04,654
Don't listen to that man, he's lying

235
00:27:04,654 --> 00:27:05,849
What are you saying?

236
00:27:05,849 --> 00:27:08,577
What happened? / Calm down

237
00:27:08,577 --> 00:27:11,480
Please, don't do this / I've ended up in this situation again

238
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:17,032
Don't listen to that man / You're not the first

239
00:27:17,032 --> 00:27:19,289
Bring all guys here

240
00:27:19,289 --> 00:27:22,536
That man's story is a lie

241
00:27:22,536 --> 00:27:24,211
Come out here and find me

242
00:27:24,211 --> 00:27:26,842
Don't worry / Check at school

243
00:27:26,842 --> 00:27:30,596
We'll go through the sewage / Sewage?

244
00:27:41,771 --> 00:27:44,889
Sylvia!

245
00:27:53,530 --> 00:27:55,696
Didn't you follow the oil?

246
00:27:55,696 --> 00:28:02,954
I couldn't get rid of Meril, I'm too weak.

247
00:28:02,954 --> 00:28:05,871
I don't fit with Meril.

248
00:28:05,871 --> 00:28:12,041
Wait, what's this? I'll get thirsty waiting for the drink.

249
00:28:12,041 --> 00:28:14,021
Can I borrow it?

250
00:29:00,641 --> 00:29:03,268
That's not it...

251
00:29:30,220 --> 00:29:36,832
Another day has dawned, let's enjoy it with the radio

252
00:29:46,513 --> 00:29:54,820
Queue up, stand by

253
00:29:58,527 --> 00:30:01,533
We're entering the square, everyone, stand by

254
00:30:01,533 --> 00:30:06,281
We'll arrive there in 90 seconds

255
00:30:06,281 --> 00:30:09,164
Making a left turn at Lancaster Square

256
00:30:09,164 --> 00:30:11,961
"Lancaster Square"

257
00:30:11,961 --> 00:30:17,200
I almost hit someone, adjust the frequency

258
00:30:21,633 --> 00:30:25,759
A moment, there's been some broadcasting issues

259
00:30:25,759 --> 00:30:29,232
Sometimes such mistakes happen

260
00:30:29,232 --> 00:30:34,022
I've prepared comfortable music today

261
00:30:34,022 --> 00:30:36,148
Remember to drive safely

262
00:30:36,148 --> 00:30:42,707
That's how you become a great driver, what's that? Yes

263
00:30:42,707 --> 00:30:47,456
"Ghost patrol"

264
00:33:43,792 --> 00:33:45,381
Would you like help?

265
00:33:45,381 --> 00:33:49,300
I have an appointment with a customer, go to the desk

266
00:33:53,939 --> 00:33:55,979
What is that? Nothing at all

267
00:33:56,598 --> 00:34:00,064
What are you doing? Don't worry

268
00:34:00,064 --> 00:34:39,051
Those people... tell me what's going on!

269
00:34:39,051 --> 00:34:40,439
Hey!

270
00:34:40,439 --> 00:34:43,731
Truman, what's going on? Talk to me

271
00:34:43,731 --> 00:34:45,401
I'm busy, come back later...

272
00:34:45,401 --> 00:34:48,407
No, it's important

273
00:34:48,407 --> 00:34:51,151
Did you see a ghost? I have to stop it with my own hands

274
00:34:51,151 --> 00:34:52,276
What am I supposed to stop?

