816
01:26:20,532 --> 01:26:24,251
Stop the broadcast / continue

817
01:26:27,419 --> 01:26:31,336
That means increase the storm's intensity!

818
01:26:33,119 --> 01:26:34,216
This is my final warning.

819
01:26:34,216 --> 01:26:35,674
Until the end / It's over.

820
01:26:35,674 --> 01:26:37,677
Raise it to the highest level / Really, this is how it will be?

821
01:26:37,677 --> 01:26:40,593
Your stomach will flip / Get it over with!

822
01:26:40,593 --> 01:26:43,557
You might drown / Hurry up!

823
01:26:43,557 --> 01:26:45,763
Now!

824
01:27:39,278 --> 01:27:41,234
Enough now.

825
01:31:51,777 --> 01:31:53,654
I'll speak.

826
01:32:12,046 --> 01:32:17,840
Truman, speak.

827
01:32:18,307 --> 01:32:21,559
I've heard enough.

828
01:32:24,347 --> 01:32:25,401
Who is it?

829
01:32:25,401 --> 01:32:32,999
I create a pro who brings hope and joy to millions.

830
01:32:36,026 --> 01:32:37,903
Who am I?

831
01:32:37,903 --> 01:32:40,919
You're a star.

832
01:32:45,325 --> 01:32:49,767
They were all fake/ You're real.

833
01:32:50,094 --> 01:32:54,596
It's a pleasure to meet you, my story is yours!

834
01:32:54,596 --> 01:33:02,381
There's no truth in this world, but the place I created is different

835
01:33:02,381 --> 01:33:07,805
This world is filled only with lies and tricks

836
01:33:07,805 --> 01:33:14,502
There's nothing to fear in the world I created

837
01:33:16,270 --> 01:33:18,779
I know Janel better than anyone

838
01:33:18,779 --> 01:33:21,316
Shut up

839
01:33:23,115 --> 01:33:28,167
Are you scared? So you can't leave

840
01:33:31,875 --> 01:33:37,218
It's okay, I understand

841
01:33:37,218 --> 01:33:40,594
I've watched your life

842
01:33:42,522 --> 01:33:45,223
The day you were born

843
01:33:47,349 --> 01:33:50,963
The first step you took

844
01:33:54,228 --> 01:33:57,440
When you entered school

845
01:33:59,528 --> 01:34:03,155
Even the very first lie...

846
01:34:06,548 --> 01:34:09,046
I can't leave

847
01:34:10,412 --> 01:34:11,504
Please help me

848
01:34:11,504 --> 01:34:15,842
I'm stuck here/ aren't you

849
01:34:16,330 --> 01:34:18,869
My world...

850
01:34:19,931 --> 01:34:25,283
Say it, anything

851
01:34:28,137 --> 01:34:31,821
They said it's live now

852
01:34:31,821 --> 01:34:35,232
It's a live broadcast!

853
01:34:51,296 --> 01:34:54,176
Greetings

854
01:34:54,176 --> 01:34:58,028
Good afternoon, good morning, good night

855
01:35:37,263 --> 01:35:40,214
It's hard, Truman!

856
01:35:48,634 --> 01:35:51,819
Broadcast stopped/ Broadcast stopped!

857
01:35:55,435 --> 01:35:58,698
Give me another piece?/ No, that's enough

858
01:35:58,698 --> 01:36:00,069
What are you doing elsewhere?/ I don't know

859
01:36:00,069 --> 01:36:01,975
No TV guide?
